{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"13972","name":"NH Barcelona Les Corts","description":"The NH Barcelona Les Corts hotel is a mere 6-minute walk from L'Illa Diagonal Mall and less than a kilometer from Les Corts metro station which provides links to the city center. Additional local points of interest include Las Ramblas, Camp Nou, and Santa Eulalia Cathedral. For buses to the beautiful beach, guests need only walk to the stop located 5 minutes away from the hotel. All of the our 81 bright and contemporary guest rooms come with modern comforts such as free Wi-Fi, wood floors, flat screen TVs, and minibars. Larger, upgraded room types also offer coffee and tea makers, and extra space for an additional bed. Each morning a scrumptious breakfast buffet is freshly prepared for our guests. Made-to-order hot dishes and an early bird breakfast are also available upon request. For delicious lunch and dinner selections, our friendly staff will gladly provide recommendations for highly-rated local restaurants. Our professional 24-hour front desk staff are ready to respond to guest requests for additional amenities such as providing extra beds and wake up service.","address":"Calle Nicaragua, 146, 146","city":"Barcelona España","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"08029","lat":41.3874229,"lng":2.136601799999994,"stars":3,"chain":"NH","giataCode":"51068","phone":"933181900","email":"NHLESCORTS@NH-HOTELS.COM","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/013972/013972a_hb_a_914.jpg?20240525141251?20250618210053","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/013972/013972a_hb_a_915.jpg?20241011081821?20250618210052","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/013972/013972a_hb_l_002.jpg?20250107160426?20250618210054","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/013972/013972a_hb_l_001.jpg?20250107160427?20250618210054","category":"lobby","or